WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.705 --> 00:00:10.785
Every lift keeps its own history. See how far you've come, and what to aim for next time.

2
00:00:11.141 --> 00:00:12.101
Here's how.

3
00:00:12.455 --> 00:00:16.375
Open the Progress tab, and tap Lift progress.

4
00:00:16.724 --> 00:00:19.364
Tap a lift, like the bench press.

5
00:00:19.717 --> 00:00:23.877
With Premium, the chart shows your estimated one rep max climbing.

6
00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:28.640
Tap Heaviest for your top weight each session. That one's free.

7
00:00:28.991 --> 00:00:32.271
Next time gives you the weight and reps to aim for.

8
00:00:32.624 --> 00:00:36.224
Best reps at each weight lists the rep records to beat.

9
00:00:36.582 --> 00:00:40.822
And every session is here, with a gold paw on each record.
